# Scrabbling Skullcrab, "Eerie - Whenever an enchantment you control enters ..., target player mills two cards": a Mox Sapphire
# entering after it (an artifact) triggers nothing; Bot1's Flood (an enchantment) targets Bot2, who mills exactly two; a second Flood
# targets Bot1 itself, who mills exactly two (any player is a legal target); Bot2's own Flood on its turn is not an enchantment
# Bot1 controls, so nothing more is milled. Library counts are checked after each step.

